   "note": "`volere` (to want): `voglio, vuoi, vuole, vogliamo, volete, vogliono`. To order politely, say `vorrei` (I'd like). Use `un` with masculine nouns, `una` with feminine ones and `un'` before a feminine noun starting with a vowel. In many Italian bars you pay at the `cassa` first, then order at the counter.",
